### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "admin", "senha": "admin123"}

### Cadastrar aluno (use o token retornado no login)
POST http://localhost:8000/alunos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome": "Ana Beatriz Souza", "data_nascimento": "2012-03-15",
 "nome_responsavel": "Carla Souza", "email_responsavel": "carla.souza@email.com"}

### Criar turma
POST http://localhost:8000/turmas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome": "8º Ano A", "ano_letivo": 2027, "vagas": 30,
 "disciplinas": [{"codigo": "MAT", "nome": "Matemática", "carga_horaria": 160}]}

### Matricular
POST http://localhost:8000/turmas/{{turma_id}}/matriculas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"aluno_id": "{{aluno_id}}"}

### Lançar nota
POST http://localhost:8000/avaliacoes/notas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"aluno_id": "{{aluno_id}}", "turma_id": "{{turma_id}}", "disciplina_codigo": "MAT", "bimestre": 1, "valor": 8.5}

### Mensalidades do aluno
GET http://localhost:8000/financeiro/alunos/{{aluno_id}}/mensalidades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Boletim
GET http://localhost:8000/relatorios/boletim/{{aluno_id}}?turma={{turma_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
